{
  "name": "@bandonker/opencode-sessions",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "description": "Spawn, brief, await, read, follow up on, hand off to and cancel fresh child sessions without blocking the server event loop. Adds targeted project presence: a brief about only the sessions that bear on yours, and an enforced file lock so two agents take turns on one file.",
